    <mxCell id="c_44" value="📑 &lt;b&gt;Quotation Module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Propose commercial items &amp;amp; rates&lt;br/&gt;• Auto FY Prefix (e.g. AE/26-27/30)&lt;br/&gt;• Terms, Delivery &amp;amp; Validity block&lt;br/&gt;• Export: PDF Print / Word (.doc)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;" parent="c_43" vertex="1">
