    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="c_46" value="🧾 &lt;b&gt;Tax Invoice Engine (GST)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;In-State (Maharashtra):&lt;/b&gt; 9% CGST + 9% SGST&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Out-of-State:&lt;/b&gt; 18% IGST (Auto-detected via GSTIN)&lt;br/&gt;• Billed-to &amp;amp; Shipped-to Client Parties&lt;br/&gt;• Digital Stamp &amp;amp; Signature embed&lt;br/&gt;• PDF Print Dialog &amp;amp; Word (.doc) output" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;" parent="c_43" vertex="1">
