    <mxCell id="c_91" value="🔒 &lt;b&gt;Atomic Safe-Write File Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Writes to &lt;code&gt;filename.tmp&lt;/code&gt; first, then atomic &lt;code&gt;fs.renameSync&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Serialized Promise chain prevents concurrency corruption&lt;br/&gt;• UTF-8 CSV parsing with RFC-4180 quotes handling&lt;br/&gt;• Configurations in &lt;code&gt;company.json&lt;/code&gt; (Profiles/Stamps) and &lt;code&gt;mail.json&lt;/code&gt; (SMTP Credentials)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;" parent="c_75" vertex="1">
